    {
      "sentence_id": 3,
      "text": "S No directions and  Registrar's order  with Signatures  13.02. C482 No.2140 of 2022  2023 Hon'ble Alok Kumar Verma, J.\ns Heard Mr. Aditya Singh, learned counsel for the applicant - accused and Mr. B.S. Thind, learned Brief Holder for the State.",
